Only recipe *structure* was taken — which item goes in which slot, in what
quantity, and the wiki's own flags for shapeless, fixed and "Matching"
recipes. No wiki prose, no wiki images or sprites, and no wiki templates are
included in this repository, and no wiki content is loaded at run time.

Everything else
---------------

All other content of this project — the game code, the block and item names,
the mobs, the procedurally generated textures and all audio — is original to
Voxelhaven and is covered by the project's MIT licence (declared as
`license: MIT` in package.json).

Tools
-----

The scraper in tools/ reads the public pages of the Minecraft Wiki at a rate of
at most one request per second, respects that site's robots.txt, and caches
every response on disk. The game itself never makes a network request.
